<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 22.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 22.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.16    2.15</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	12.76    1.96</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	10.10    0.97</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.87    0.76</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	 9.34    1.08</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.12    1.79</p>
<p> 7   Natl Consol	     9.00    1.00</p>
<p> 8   Villa World	     8.70    1.15</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.69    0.99</p>
<p>10   Equitilink		8.62    0.58</p>
<p>11   Hills Inds		8.55    2.00</p>
<p>12   Countrywide-PP	  8.54    1.19</p>
<p>13   Gandel Retail Tr	8.49    0.92</p>
<p>14   Natl In Prop	    8.43    1.04</p>
<p>15   Ipoh			8.41    2.14</p>
